Bio-Inspired Hybrid RL for Object Navigation
Copyright 2026 [Aleksey Isaev]

This product was designed and implemented by [Aleksey Isaev].

Original research and implementation includes:
- Episodic Memory Q-Store with HNSW nearest-neighbor search and Gaussian
  kernel Q-value approximation
- Soft Actor-Critic (SAC) parametric policy with Behavioral Cloning warm-start
- Adaptive Arbitrator with confidence × track record action source selection
- Phase-driven navigation system with six behavioral phases and strategic/
  tactical decision hierarchy
- Frame-invariant state representation enabling zero-shot
  sim-to-sim transfer
- Environment-agnostic protocol for deployment on any simulator or robot

